      "content": "i hear you, but it doesn't feel like a choice for them. they're stuck. it's like they're tethered to my struggle and they can't move forward because they're too busy watching me. i just want them to be free, you know? i want them to have their lives back without this constant shadow hanging over them. it feels so much more selfless to just stop taking up all their space.",
